setid 1 ms
setup (480 entries) 1 ms
TOF table loaded
image loaded in 5516 ms
forward 1 ms
clear 1 ms
back 1 ms
read back done
TIMING fwd tokens 2010 rep1 0 ms rep20000 275 ms
TIMING back tokens 2010 rep1 0 ms rep20000 275 ms
% exit: null
    while executing
"exit"
% 